# Oh-F-Star-4

id:world-oh-f-star-4 a oa:Place, oa:World ;
    skos:prefLabel "Oh-F-Star-4" ;
    oa:article <https://www.orionsarm.com/eg-article/4758a9926c452> ;
    oa:kind "system" ;
    oa:labelsSystem false ;
    oa:note "The near end of an alien wormhole, and the capital of the Carina Rush — which is the volume the wormhole opened and not this system, so the marker keeps the star's own name. In Carina at 2,246 ly and within a twentieth of a degree of the galactic plane, the flattest thing in this file. The add-on's designation carries a trailing hyphen that the name does not.\nNo holder is recorded. This entry carried the Non-Coercive Zone for a while on no authority at all — the add-on's file gives a position and nothing else, and nothing said whose the Rush is. An empty field is the honest answer until something says otherwise." ;
    oa:uncertain false .

claim:location-world-oh-f-star-4 a prov:Entity, oa:LocationClaim ;
    prov:hadPrimarySource <https://www.orionsarm.com/eg-article/4758a9926c452> ;
    oa:about id:world-oh-f-star-4 ;
    oa:canonical true ;
    oa:catalogueFromSource false ;
    oa:knownDistanceConflict false ;
    oa:method oa:DirectTranscription ;
    oa:oaStarName "Oh-F-Star-4-" .

