    oa:hidden false ;
    oa:note "The near end of an alien wormhole, and the capital of the Carina Rush. Labelled for the star and not for the Rush, which is the large volume the wormhole opened rather than this one system. The add-on's designation ends in a hyphen the name does not; the label drops it. No affiliation: this entry claimed the Non-Coercive Zone for a while with nothing behind it." ;
